.anthropic_key
*.csv
__pycache__/

# The data files ARE the deliverable here: without them the report in
# output/ cannot be reproduced from a clone. They are small, plain text and
# contain no credentials, so the blanket *.csv rule above is negated for
# data/ only -- a stray CSV anywhere else stays ignored.
!data/*.csv

# Conversation exports (/export) reproduce the entire session, including the
# name, email address and absolute home paths that were deliberately stripped
# from the generated report. Local only -- never committed.
*.log
